# research-opportunities-agent — daily discovery schedule
#
# Install for the `hermes` user with:  crontab cron/opportunity-scout.cron
# (or paste the line below into `crontab -e`)
#
# Fires 15:00 UTC = 20:00 PKT (Pakistan, UTC+5), once daily.
# scout.py is self-contained: it loads ~/.hermes/.env itself and is stdlib-only.
# Output (searched/verified/new counts, any rate-limit notes) is appended to the log.

0 15 * * * /usr/bin/python3 /home/hermes/.hermes/skills/opportunity-scout/scripts/scout.py >> /home/hermes/.hermes/logs/opportunity-scout.log 2>&1
